  },
  "rules": [
   "Units: g, mg, mcg (the regulation's µg). [low, high]; null is no bound (a 'Min' or 'Max' row).",
   "Only rows a label can print are kept: moisture, ash, fibre, ratios, milk fat, amino acids and nutrients per 100 ml of the prepared feed are left out.",
   "Folate is left out: the tables are in dietary folate equivalents (1 microgram DFE = 0.6 microgram folic acid, their footnote) and labels print folic acid.",
   "Traditional foods (11) have no composition table: nothing is compared.",
   "Only the per 100 g column is compared; a label's per 100 kcal or per 100 ml figure is not read here."
